rooms_desc ({"Welcome to Aisha's Gateway to the Worlds.  This fantastic room is filledwith memories from everywhere Aisha has been.  For your enjoyment andcomfort, Aisha has even added special portals to take you to some of thewonderful places you can visit while here in the land of Holy Mission.  To the west begins the rest of Aisha's house.  Enjoy your stay!","You step into a warm, cozy den.  Aisha has taken much care to make thisden reflect her personal tastes.  Along the north wall there is a gigantic fireplace.  A bright fire crackles playfully in the hearth.  Youcan easily imagine a delightfully romantic evening before the fire onthe gigantic bear skin rug.  There is a beautiful baby grand piano in thecorner.  If you ask nicely, maybe Aisha will play you something!  With agasp you notice the magestric bay window set into the western wall.  Outsidethe snow is gently falling making the fire seem even cozier.  You gaze inawe at the beautiful array of stars that paint the sky.  The view from thewindow is simply breathtaking.  Set into the south wall is a very modernentertainment center that proudly displays Aisha's prized possessions--acomplete collection of Walt Disney movies.  In the center of the room, acomfortable couch invites you to sit back, relax and enjoy hours of conversation with Aisha.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
